OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon opens new #107m
OL,4,Adistribution centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnline retail giant Amazon has opened a
OL,7,Fnew #107m distribution centre in
OL,8,FPeterborough, which is set to create
OL,9,F1,400 jobs in the city.
OL,11,FThe building, on Flaxley Road, is next
OL,12,Fto an existing site the company runs,
OL,13,Fwhich opened in 2010. It currently
OL,14,Femploys more than 1,000 members of
OL,15,Fstaff.
OL,17,FThe 690,000 sq ft site is part of the
OL,18,Fcompany's #40bn UK investment plan for
OL,19,F2025-27 and is expected to ship up to
OL,20,Ffive million items a week.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
