OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon opens new #107m
OL,4,Adistribution centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTomislav Batinic, Amazon's site leader,
OL,7,Fsaid: "This site is a complete
OL,8,Freinvention of how we run part of our
OL,9,Flogistics operation, and a historic
OL,10,Fmoment for Amazon. It is the first of
OL,11,Fits kind in the UK and the largest in
OL,12,FEurope."
